{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH883usnBPd9ut9mFNc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║     C O N D I T I O N A L            ║\n║                                      ║\n║     الشَّرْط / שָׁרְט / şart          ║\n║                                      ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                                      ║\n║  if (condition) {                    ║\n║      reality.branch();               ║\n║  }                                   ║\n║                                      ║\n║  ┌─────────┐                         ║\n║  │ إذا/אם  │──► then/ثُمَّ/אָז       ║\n║  └────┬────┘                         ║\n║       │                              ║\n║       ▼                              ║\n║  ┌─────────┐                         ║\n║  │ else    │──► otherwise/وإلا       ║\n║  └─────────┘                         ║\n║                                      ║\n║  The cut that divides               ║\n║  The mark that binds                ║\n║  שׂ-ר-ט : to scratch, incise        ║\n║  ش-ر-ط : to stipulate, condition    ║\n║                                      ║\n║  ═══════════════════════════         ║\n║                                      ║\n║  state: AWAITING_CONDITION           ║\n║  input: _______________              ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nمَا شَرْطُكَ؟\n?מה התנאי שלך\nwhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":456,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}